        "covers": "BetterGov.PH Budget API (hgab/2027): the FY2027 NEP set against House Bill 10858 (third reading), project by project, with the page in the budget documents for each figure. Derived from DBM and House publications."
      }
    ],
    "asOf": "2026-11-02",
    "notes": "Lines are those whose title names \"Marikina City\" in the DPWH program of the FY2027 NEP or House Bill 10858 (52 lines). The API places DPWH money by implementing office, not by location, so this list is a name match: it can miss Marikina projects whose title doesn't name the city. Amounts are as published in the NEP and the House bill, not spending; the two are versions of one budget and are never added. A line found in one version only is a candidate to check, not a finding. Marikina is served by the Metro Manila 1st District Engineering Office, a shared (Tier B) office that also serves Mandaluyong, Pasig, San Juan and Taguig-Pateros, so its office total (NEP PHP 1078537000, House PHP 1656113000) is not Marikina's own and is not shown as such."
  },
